        "\n",
        "<details><summary>Hint</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "`TN, FP, FN, TP = confusion_matrix(val['left'], val['risk'] >= 0.5).ravel()`. Contacting nobody gets every student who stayed right, so its accuracy is `1 - val['left'].mean()`.\n",
        "</details>"
