        "\n",
        "<details><summary>Hint</summary>\n",
        "\n",
        "Net value at a cut-off = TP × HELPS × COST_LEAVE − (TP + FP) × COST_TALK − FP × COST_WORRY. Break-even: the formula above is zero at p = (500 + 2,000) / (0.30 × 60,000 + 2,000).\n",
        "</details>"
      ]
